  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your practice at the use of a particular inflection makes it easier to recite again and again.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Any five inflections</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The Truenaming DC Modifier and Malleability DC Modifier of a single inflection of your choice are reduced by 1, to a minimum of +0.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Inflection Specialization multiple times. Each time, it applies to a new inflection.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truemagic-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
